/E (The auditions will consist of three rounds. For the first round, participants will be given an envelope, each consisting of scrambled letters that make a word. The teams will have to put the word together within 2 minutes. The first team to do so will get 15 points, the second 10, and the third 5. The teams unable to unscramble the word will get no points. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
