/T ( In a given round, one member from the team will face the screen while the other would face the audience. The participant facing the screen would have to get across the given word to her/his team member without using the ancillary words \(the taboo words\). Even if the guessing member of the team has correctly guessed a taboo word, the other member must not use the word himself/herself to explain the given word. )
/E ( In a given round, one member from the team will face the screen while the other would face the audience. The participant facing the screen would have to get across the given word to her/his team member without using the ancillary words \(the taboo words\). Even if the guessing member of the team has correctly guessed a taboo word, the other member must not use the word himself/herself to explain the given word. )
