/ActualText (When you see pieces of literary writing, old books, newspapers, prose, poetry what is it that comes to your mind? Do those old books on your shelf draw out a piece of poetry only known to you? Then welcome to black-out poetry - where the old gets re-furbished in your mind, now for us and the world to see.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
