/ActualText (We all have a whole world of imagination lurking in the corner of our minds. A whole myriad of places to go to and characters to explore, people to meet and times to travel to. Let your own, flow in the direction of this world and pen down the vivid picture of your explorations and give a voice to your characters. If there is such a world then look no further, Script writing is the event for you.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
